-------+----------+------------------------------------------
 31412 | 00:00:41 | SELECT o.*, r.name FROM orders o JOIN re
```

Statement: "The new setting applies to every session of the role at once, so this 41-second query proves the setting is ignored."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'False. A role''s settings are applied when a session starts. Connections that PgBouncer or the pods'' pools already hold keep the old value until they reconnect (PgBouncer''s `server_lifetime`, a pod restart, or `RECONNECT` in the PgBouncer console). New sessions get 5s. `SHOW statement_timeout` on a fresh connection confirms it. The misconception is that ALTER ROLE changes live sessions.', 2, 5
