Statement: "`RENAME COLUMN` changes only the catalog and finished in 4 ms, so it is safe to run before a rolling update; the 4 minutes of errors must have another cause."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'False. The rename is fast, but speed is not the question: the old pods (`api-6f9c7d-*`) keep running until the rollout replaces them, and their SQL still names `customer_phone`, which no longer exists. Every request they served failed until the last old pod was gone. A rename is a breaking change for the code that is still running; expand and contract replaces it with an added column, a dual write and a later drop.', 1, 5
